{{!
    @template local_awareness/editor/shell

    The notice editor: a page head, the moodleform rendered in place, and the audience panel
    underneath it. The preview is a dialogue, opened from the form's own button bar by
    editor_preview.js.

    The preview is not built here. editor_preview.js reads the title and the body straight out of
    the form and hands them to a core/modal_cancel — the same shape the manage list uses — so what
    the author sees is the content itself rather than a drawing of it that has to be kept in step.

    The form declares its own sections, so each one is a core collapsible fieldset — accordion
    behaviour, keyboard handling and the expand/collapse-all control all come from core. Its own
    button group is the sticky action bar, styled in place: buttons outside the form would need a
    form="" attribute, which is real HTML but which the mustache lint cannot validate in a partial
    rendered on its own, and two submit paths where one will do.

    This template used to hide the form in a clipped 1x1 container and let JavaScript move its rendered
    rows into hand-made cards; any field the relocation map forgot stayed in that container, still
    focusable and still announced by a screen reader, but painted nowhere.

    Context variables required:
    * pagetitle (string), subtitle (string)
    * statuslabel (string), statusislive (bool), statusisblocked (bool)
    * savedlabel (string) — when the notice was last saved, empty when creating
    * unsavedlabel (string) — what the save-state line says once the form is touched
    * requirements (string) — a warning to show above the form, or empty
    * formhtml (raw) — the rendered moodleform, tag and all
    * helptitle (string), helpbody (raw — may include <b>)
    * audience (object) — see audience_panel.mustache

    Example context (json):
    {
        "pagetitle": "Cadastrar aviso",
        "subtitle": "Crie um modal contextual.",
        "statuslabel": "Rascunho",
        "statusislive": false,
        "statusisblocked": false,
        "savedlabel": "Salvo em 16/08/26, 09:14",
        "unsavedlabel": "Alterações não salvas",
        "requirements": "",
        "formhtml": "<form id=\"mform1\"><input type=\"text\"></form>",
        "helptitle": "Como funciona",
        "helpbody": "Os filtros combinam por <b>interseção</b>.",
        "audience": {}
    }
}}
<div class="local-awareness-editor" data-region="la-editor">
    <div class="la-shell la-shell--single">
        <main class="la-shell-main">

            <div class="la-pagehead">
                <div class="la-pagehead-title">
                    <h2>{{pagetitle}}</h2>
                    <p class="la-pagehead-sub">{{subtitle}}</p>
                </div>
                <div class="la-pagehead-meta">
                    <span class="la-status-badge {{#statusislive}}la-status-badge--live{{/statusislive}}{{#statusisblocked}}la-status-badge--blocked{{/statusisblocked}}">
                        <span class="la-status-badge-ping" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        {{statuslabel}}
                    </span>
                    {{#savedlabel}}
                        <span class="la-pagehead-autosaved" data-region="la-savestate"
                              data-label-unsaved="{{unsavedlabel}}">{{savedlabel}}</span>
                    {{/savedlabel}}
                </div>
            </div>

            {{#requirements}}
                <div class="la-req-banner" role="status">
                    <i class="fa fa-exclamation-triangle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <span>{{requirements}}</span>
                </div>
            {{/requirements}}

            <div class="la-navhelp" role="note">
                <h3 class="la-navhelp-title"><i class="fa fa-info-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{helptitle}}</h3>
                <div class="la-navhelp-body">{{{helpbody}}}</div>
            </div>

            {{{formhtml}}}

            {{> local_awareness/editor/audience_panel }}

        </main>
    </div>

</div>
